Imports runtime/root/darwin, whose boot module binds libSystem extern
functions (mmap/pthread via SPEC 11.7). Bit's fully static ELF output has no
dynamic symbol table, so both Linux targets reject those declarations (E0078)
even when uncalled — this program is macOS-only by construction. The stress
harness skips any directory containing this marker on a non-Darwin host. The
Linux twin rtSpawn (runtime/root/linux, identical body) is covered by rootpins
and `bit build runtime/root/linux --emit-obj --target x86_64-linux`.
